WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.220 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 36]

01:40.480 --> 01:40.930
Changhe,

01:42.280 --> 01:43.620
Master Mu and Xuewei are dead.

01:45.640 --> 01:46.180
Changhe!

01:47.590 --> 01:48.410
I heard you!

01:49.510 --> 01:50.710
They wouldn't have died

01:50.710 --> 01:51.570
if we were around.

01:52.710 --> 01:53.740
We're members of Blood River.

01:55.790 --> 01:56.690
We're assassins.

01:58.920 --> 02:00.490
To us, life-or-death situations

02:00.590 --> 02:02.050
are as common as our meals.

02:03.310 --> 02:04.660
So, to you,

02:06.000 --> 02:07.490
the members of Blood River

02:08.430 --> 02:09.980
are still assassins, huh?

02:15.360 --> 02:16.610
We haven't reached the Other Shore yet.

02:18.910 --> 02:20.500
And, we're still under the control of someone else.

02:22.400 --> 02:23.060
Do you understand

02:23.070 --> 02:24.450
First Prince's plan?

02:28.310 --> 02:29.820
He wants the generals and marquises, who were blackmailed by him

02:30.560 --> 02:32.570
by turning their family members into drugged puppets,

02:32.800 --> 02:34.340
to cause a riot in Tianqi City

02:34.520 --> 02:35.940
on the night before the Imperial Assembly.

02:37.680 --> 02:39.340
At the same time, he'll bring out the Dragonseal Scroll.

02:39.520 --> 02:41.100
He'll initiate both of these events

02:41.150 --> 02:41.850
at the same time.

02:41.870 --> 02:43.260
After that, he'll frame Prince of Langya for them.

02:44.560 --> 02:46.290
Lastly, he'll show up to quell the chaos

02:46.470 --> 02:47.690
by killing Prince of Langya.

02:48.800 --> 02:50.820
With that, he'll absorb Prince of Langya's faction

02:51.560 --> 02:53.170
and pave a path to the throne he desires.

02:54.030 --> 02:54.570
Indeed.

02:57.680 --> 02:59.060
If someone were to mention that plan to me

02:59.120 --> 02:59.740
a few months ago,

02:59.740 --> 03:01.010
I would laugh it off.

03:02.560 --> 03:04.050
But now, it seems Prince of Langya

03:04.050 --> 03:05.660
is in a tight spot as well.

03:06.190 --> 03:06.980
On the battlefield,

03:07.430 --> 03:08.780
Lei Mengsha was defeated and retreated to Mount Luolei.

03:09.680 --> 03:10.500
In the imperial court,

03:10.630 --> 03:12.220
the emperor no longer trusts him as much.

03:12.910 --> 03:13.820
And, his main guardians

03:14.710 --> 03:16.570
have left him one by one as well.

03:18.000 --> 03:19.340
So, Changhe, are you choosing to side with

03:19.360 --> 03:20.500
the powerful to reap more profit?

03:22.360 --> 03:23.380
I'm driven solely by profit.

03:24.750 --> 03:26.410
That has always been my biggest strength,

03:27.000 --> 03:27.610
hasn't it?

03:33.080 --> 03:34.270
But Prince of Langya has a reputation

03:34.270 --> 03:35.600
of making the world tremble.

03:35.600 --> 03:36.690
Could he truly be this weak?

03:38.080 --> 03:40.010
Could it be that he's using Blood River to his advantage?

03:42.400 --> 03:43.780
Changhe, do you mean

03:45.080 --> 03:46.380
Prince of Langya is acting weak on purpose?

03:46.870 --> 03:47.500
Changli,

03:48.470 --> 03:49.410
give me some time alone.

03:51.280 --> 03:52.660
You can take a stroll around Tianqi City.

03:53.680 --> 03:54.290
It's because

03:56.190 --> 03:57.820
we'll leave soon.

04:13.520 --> 04:14.410
It's indeed

04:14.470 --> 04:15.850
a city worth longing for.

04:17.390 --> 04:18.810
Especially at nighttime.

04:20.630 --> 04:21.730
It's just like

04:23.870 --> 04:25.220
the saying...

04:26.870 --> 04:27.660
What is it again?

04:29.950 --> 04:31.410
"In heaven stands the White Jade Capital,

04:32.160 --> 04:33.610
with 12 towers and 5 cities.

04:34.510 --> 04:35.900
Immortals brush my crown,

04:36.830 --> 04:38.540
granting me eternal life with a touch upon my hair".

04:45.040 --> 04:46.580
I suppose Tianqi City does live up to its name.

04:47.560 --> 04:49.810
I was admiring the moon on the rooftop alone.

04:50.630 --> 04:51.780
But when I turn around,

04:51.870 --> 04:53.410
a sword deity is standing right beside me.

04:54.360 --> 04:56.460
Greetings, Li Hanyi, the Xueyue Sword Deity.

04:57.630 --> 04:59.170
If you move,

05:00.000 --> 05:01.020
I'm afraid

05:01.830 --> 05:03.290
my sword will draw blood.

05:03.680 --> 05:05.580
Xueyue Sword Deity, what are you doing in Tianqi City?

05:06.510 --> 05:07.250
If so, Patriarch,

05:07.830 --> 05:09.250
what are you doing in Tianqi City as well?

05:10.160 --> 05:10.810
We came here

05:10.830 --> 05:11.810
for the same person.

05:13.120 --> 05:13.980
It's Prince of Langya.

05:16.360 --> 05:17.250
Patriarch,

05:17.830 --> 05:18.810
you're getting better and better.

05:19.270 --> 05:20.580
We can spar with each other in a few days

05:21.560 --> 05:22.490
if the opportunity arises.

05:32.920 --> 05:33.900
This is news from

05:33.920 --> 05:34.660
the Inner Security Division.

05:39.940 --> 05:42.740
[Imperial mausoleum, Zhuo Qing, Dragonseal Scroll]

05:49.630 --> 05:50.290
I knew it.

06:25.360 --> 06:26.140
Li Zhengqi.

06:26.830 --> 06:27.490
Where are you?

06:29.000 --> 06:29.780
Li Zhengqi?

06:49.870 --> 06:51.170
Why did I give birth

06:51.190 --> 06:52.250
to a useless fool like you?

06:52.950 --> 06:53.700
How can you face

06:53.750 --> 06:55.290
the ancestors of the Li family like this?

06:57.830 --> 06:58.460
Useless fool.

06:59.000 --> 07:00.290
You're a useless fool!

07:03.240 --> 07:04.220
No wonder his son was forced

07:04.360 --> 07:05.410
to seek out such a method

07:05.480 --> 07:06.700
to increase his strength.

07:07.310 --> 07:07.930
I thought he was

07:08.000 --> 07:09.370
a kind father

07:09.560 --> 07:10.850
when I saw him protecting his son back then.

07:13.750 --> 07:14.900
Father!

07:16.160 --> 07:17.610
I'll surely win the Golden Throne Contest.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.580
I'll definitely win the position of deputy general.

07:20.000 --> 07:20.900
You have to trust me.

07:21.800 --> 07:22.780
Fine.

07:23.240 --> 07:25.410
I shall wait for your good news.

07:36.360 --> 07:36.850
Forget it.

07:37.240 --> 07:37.810
I didn't come here

07:38.160 --> 07:39.540
to peek at your past.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.410
How is it?

07:54.950 --> 07:55.980
Your cultivation realm should be

07:56.070 --> 07:57.250
completely stabilized by now.

07:57.720 --> 07:58.170
Uncle Zhe.

07:59.360 --> 08:00.490
Why don't you need to take any medicine?

08:01.560 --> 08:02.540
I'm not injured.

08:02.750 --> 08:03.540
Why should I take medicine?

08:05.160 --> 08:06.020
I merely

08:06.390 --> 08:07.850
imparted some of my powers to you.

08:08.430 --> 08:09.050
Moreover,

08:09.270 --> 08:10.020
my daughter also gave me

08:10.040 --> 08:10.980
an acupuncture treatment.

08:12.510 --> 08:13.660
Right now,

08:15.560 --> 08:17.410
I feel superb.

08:19.480 --> 08:20.100
She told me

08:20.630 --> 08:21.850
that she'd help me to regulate my body

08:22.190 --> 08:24.410
to deal with the long-term backlash

08:24.750 --> 08:25.250
sustained by

08:25.630 --> 08:27.370
the practitioners of Divine-Demon Nirvana Art.

08:27.560 --> 08:28.340
If it doesn't work out,

08:28.510 --> 08:30.020
we can still depend on Baicao.

08:31.560 --> 08:32.700
I suppose I can rest at ease

08:33.670 --> 08:34.850
if you'll be fine after this.

08:38.240 --> 08:39.530
That's all in the future.

08:40.080 --> 08:40.890
She said

08:42.030 --> 08:43.390
that once the issue in Tianqi City

08:43.390 --> 08:44.250
has been resolved,

08:44.720 --> 08:46.220
she would take me with her to Medicine King Valley.

08:47.390 --> 08:47.890
She said

08:48.630 --> 08:50.010
that there are several straw huts there.

08:50.670 --> 08:52.060
There are also some cattle, sheep,

08:52.440 --> 08:53.460
and a small vegetable plot.

08:54.030 --> 08:54.890
I suppose

08:55.270 --> 08:57.060
life there will be dull and uninteresting.

08:57.480 --> 08:58.340
But luckily,

08:58.840 --> 08:59.530
there's a valley

08:59.670 --> 09:01.250
filled with all kinds

09:01.320 --> 09:02.100
of mystical herbs

09:02.550 --> 09:03.060
and

09:03.200 --> 09:04.890
the number one Medicine King in the world.

09:06.750 --> 09:07.340
She also said

09:07.750 --> 09:09.010
that as long as they join hands,

09:10.600 --> 09:13.130
even the envoys of Hell have to wait for decades

09:13.510 --> 09:15.050
before they can reap one's life.

09:23.390 --> 09:24.220
What do you think?

09:25.630 --> 09:26.460
I think it's fine.

09:27.440 --> 09:28.730
If the two miracle physicians treat you at the same time,

09:29.870 --> 09:31.010
I'm sure you can recover completely.

09:31.790 --> 09:32.580
That's not it.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.220
That's not what I mean.

09:34.750 --> 09:35.700
What I meant was,

09:36.150 --> 09:38.020
what do you think about returning to Medicine King Valley?

09:41.150 --> 09:41.770
Aren't you joining us?

09:46.720 --> 09:47.220
All right.

10:04.200 --> 10:05.300
So, this is what it feels like

10:06.000 --> 10:06.850
when one becomes a drugged puppet.

10:07.630 --> 10:08.820
This is truly shocking.

10:09.360 --> 10:10.420
I'll end the session for now.

10:16.080 --> 10:16.890
Su Muyu?

10:29.630 --> 10:30.180
Master.

10:33.080 --> 10:33.770
I'm fine.

10:38.000 --> 10:38.730
Li Zhengqi

10:39.200 --> 10:40.300
has never met Su Muyu before.

10:41.440 --> 10:42.370
Therefore,

10:44.480 --> 10:45.530
that wasn't his inner demon.

10:48.440 --> 10:49.770
It was my inner demon.

10:50.510 --> 10:52.770
The Dragonseal Scroll surfaces, the world changes its face.

10:53.080 --> 10:55.580
When turmoil arises, Prince of Langya seals it.

10:56.000 --> 10:58.340
The Dragonseal Scroll surfaces, the world changes its face.

10:58.600 --> 11:00.890
When turmoil arises, Prince of Langya seals it.

11:01.150 --> 11:03.420
The Dragonseal Scroll surfaces, the world changes its face.

11:03.480 --> 11:04.300
Shut up!

11:04.510 --> 11:05.220
Stop singing it!

11:05.670 --> 11:06.130
Go away!

11:10.390 --> 11:11.420
This never ends.

11:19.270 --> 11:19.850
Your Highness,

11:20.390 --> 11:22.010
tomorrow's the Imperial Assembly.

11:22.390 --> 11:23.650
But for some reason,

11:23.960 --> 11:25.610
the young beggars on the streets

11:25.870 --> 11:27.250
were singing that rhyme.

11:27.510 --> 11:28.850
They also wrote the rhyme

11:29.150 --> 11:30.890
on the walls of the streets.

11:31.480 --> 11:33.680
The people are saying

11:33.680 --> 11:34.710
that the Imperial Assembly

11:34.710 --> 11:36.580
is the day you ascend the throne in front of all officials.

11:41.600 --> 11:43.820
I suppose that's appropriate.

11:44.630 --> 11:45.610
In the presence of all officials,

11:46.150 --> 11:47.300
the Mandate of Heaven was conferred.

11:47.630 --> 11:48.850
As the generals pledged their allegiance,

11:49.630 --> 11:52.420
the Imperial Star moved eastward.

11:55.320 --> 11:56.060
And,

11:56.670 --> 11:58.580
many of the generals under you

11:59.030 --> 12:00.300
have delivered confidential letters to you.

12:05.240 --> 12:05.940
What did they say?

12:07.080 --> 12:08.530
They were confidential.

12:08.670 --> 12:09.530
I dare not read them.

12:09.960 --> 12:11.460
I kept them in your study room.

12:11.630 --> 12:12.460
I'll bring them here.

12:13.870 --> 12:14.700
No need for that.

12:15.790 --> 12:16.530
Later,

12:16.910 --> 12:18.180
take this fire pit with you.

12:18.750 --> 12:19.820
Burn all of the letters.

12:20.630 --> 12:21.300
Do not leave

12:21.510 --> 12:22.370
a single word behind.

12:23.480 --> 12:24.010
Yes, Your Highness.

12:25.440 --> 12:27.980
Are we actually sending them to retrieve that item?

12:28.670 --> 12:29.340
Don't worry.

12:30.320 --> 12:31.060
Since Su Muyu

12:31.480 --> 12:32.370
has already agreed to it,

12:33.150 --> 12:34.770
he'll surely give it his all.

12:36.960 --> 12:37.820
This time,

12:38.480 --> 12:40.250
I was the one who implicated Su Muyu and his men.

12:41.030 --> 12:41.700
Therefore,

12:42.270 --> 12:43.340
both he and I

12:43.510 --> 12:44.580
have to complete

12:45.080 --> 12:46.300
our respective tasks.

12:54.200 --> 12:55.490
Bring me my fur cloak.

12:56.480 --> 12:57.460
Your Highness, are you heading out?

13:01.480 --> 13:02.770
It's time to enter the palace.

13:13.840 --> 13:14.490
This time,

13:14.960 --> 13:16.420
Ms. Wan'er helped us out of kindness.

13:17.150 --> 13:17.850
But her house was burned down

13:17.870 --> 13:18.770
because of it.

13:19.750 --> 13:21.130
I truly feel guilty about it.

13:24.080 --> 13:24.700
Master,

13:25.360 --> 13:26.830
Yu knew that you would say that.

13:27.000 --> 13:28.420
Therefore, he told me this

13:28.510 --> 13:29.460
while you were preparing the prescriptions.

13:29.670 --> 13:30.300
He said

13:30.510 --> 13:31.420
Blood River

13:31.440 --> 13:33.130
would compensate Ms. Wan'er with a huge manor after this.

13:33.840 --> 13:34.460
After all,

13:34.670 --> 13:36.730
they have plenty of money in Yellow Springs Pawnshop.

13:39.510 --> 13:40.100
Master,

13:40.750 --> 13:42.060
this is the last step, right?

13:42.750 --> 13:43.490
Once you complete this prescription,

13:43.720 --> 13:45.580
will it serve as a cure to the puppet poison?

13:47.320 --> 13:47.820
Naturally.

13:48.720 --> 13:49.340
Master,

13:49.790 --> 13:51.220
why did you separate it into two pots?

13:51.670 --> 13:52.460
And, the herbs inside

13:52.480 --> 13:53.340
are different.

13:53.630 --> 13:54.700
Your decoction is thick

13:55.030 --> 13:55.820
while mine

13:55.870 --> 13:57.340
is so clear, just like spring water.

13:57.600 --> 13:59.300
I thought I was boiling water.

14:00.080 --> 14:00.980
This pot

14:01.080 --> 14:02.420
is the cure to the puppet poison.

14:03.200 --> 14:04.010
As for that pot,

14:06.440 --> 14:07.300
I have my own use for it.

14:09.320 --> 14:10.100
I see.

14:20.550 --> 14:21.100
Yu.

14:25.380 --> 14:27.140
[Imperial mausoleum, Zhuo Qing, Dragonseal Scroll]

14:28.000 --> 14:28.890
It's tonight.

14:29.240 --> 14:30.820
We still haven't received any news from Changhe yet.

14:31.270 --> 14:31.890
Yu.

14:33.150 --> 14:33.700
Are you

14:34.550 --> 14:36.340
the only participating member of Blood River tonight?

14:37.030 --> 14:37.580
That's right.

14:39.120 --> 14:40.340
I'm the only participating member.

14:41.960 --> 14:43.940
I shall slay the specter, banish the shadow, and shatter the light.

14:47.910 --> 14:49.220
After that, we'll leave Tianqi.

14:51.750 --> 14:52.700
A new Blood River

14:54.360 --> 14:55.130
will be born

14:55.200 --> 14:56.770
tomorrow.

14:57.670 --> 14:58.980
You didn't allow me to join you.

15:00.030 --> 15:00.820
Is it because

15:02.320 --> 15:03.700
tonight will be perilous?

15:14.240 --> 15:14.820
Indeed.

15:16.000 --> 15:17.340
Tonight will be perilous.

15:19.030 --> 15:20.650
Life and death hang upon a single instant.

15:24.200 --> 15:25.370
But this is the path I chose

15:25.390 --> 15:26.530
as the leader of Blood River.

15:28.630 --> 15:29.460
Therefore,

15:29.480 --> 15:30.980
when there are obstacles ahead,

15:32.630 --> 15:33.610
I shall split it open

15:35.240 --> 15:36.420
with my sword.

15:40.910 --> 15:43.010
You may look gentle and easy to converse with,

15:43.480 --> 15:44.770
but when you decide on something,

15:45.790 --> 15:47.130
no one can persuade you to change your mind.

15:49.440 --> 15:50.220
But Yu,

15:51.550 --> 15:52.340
you're much different

15:53.550 --> 15:54.490
compared to the past.

15:59.600 --> 16:00.490
You have to be careful.

16:01.670 --> 16:02.530
I'll wait for your return.

16:12.270 --> 16:13.220
The breeze is cold.

16:13.550 --> 16:14.490
And, the crows are cawing outside.

16:15.320 --> 16:16.460
Why didn't you close the window

16:16.870 --> 16:17.820
and block out the inauspicious aura?

16:18.720 --> 16:19.490
Inauspicious aura?

16:20.790 --> 16:22.850
That's the present I'm giving to Prince of Langya.

16:23.360 --> 16:24.980
I'm listening to the mourning theme

16:25.630 --> 16:27.060
sang by the crows,

16:27.630 --> 16:29.370
which is meant for my uncle.

16:32.240 --> 16:33.250
After tonight,

16:34.550 --> 16:36.220
Prince of Langya will become a permanent stain

16:36.320 --> 16:37.850
on the records of history.

16:40.270 --> 16:41.700
He intended to rebel.

16:42.510 --> 16:44.490
In order to blackmail the officials,

16:44.840 --> 16:46.420
he kidnapped their sons

16:46.960 --> 16:48.220
and even poisoned them.

16:49.630 --> 16:51.700
He tried to use them

16:52.480 --> 16:53.250
to create

16:53.320 --> 16:54.890
an army that neither sleeps nor rests.

16:56.790 --> 16:58.130
That's truly terrifying.

17:02.550 --> 17:03.490
As for us,

17:04.400 --> 17:05.830
we're the righteous ones who have no choice

17:05.830 --> 17:07.660
but to step in and stop him.

17:08.400 --> 17:09.290
This time,

17:10.160 --> 17:11.460
I won't lose again.

17:12.310 --> 17:13.860
It's because his days are numbered.

17:15.920 --> 17:17.090
And, he's all alone.

17:21.110 --> 17:22.090
You may leave first.

17:22.640 --> 17:23.090
Yes, sir.

17:28.720 --> 17:29.250
Lord Haoyue,

17:30.030 --> 17:30.700
who served First Prince

17:30.750 --> 17:32.730
together with us, died this morning.

17:33.880 --> 17:36.090
He died from a snake's venom as he failed his mission.

17:36.440 --> 17:37.180
Someone silenced him.

17:37.790 --> 17:39.220
So, I suppose your grandson

17:40.200 --> 17:41.660
is simply grieving his own kind,

17:42.240 --> 17:43.570
like a case of the fox mourning the hare, huh?

17:44.590 --> 17:45.140
Mu.

17:45.720 --> 17:46.660
Mind your words.

17:48.000 --> 17:49.490
We're a family.

17:50.110 --> 17:51.420
There's no need to be too formal.

17:53.440 --> 17:55.290
His Highness is summoning you.

17:56.110 --> 17:57.290
Do not let him wait for too long.

17:57.750 --> 17:58.530
If so, Grandfather,

17:58.920 --> 17:59.570
granduncles,

18:00.070 --> 18:00.860
I shall take my leave first.

18:05.440 --> 18:06.010
Mu.

18:07.400 --> 18:08.420
Hurry, have a seat.

18:10.350 --> 18:11.220
Once His Highness

18:11.720 --> 18:13.530
ascends the throne tomorrow,

18:14.310 --> 18:16.050
and we render merit in founding the new dynasty,

18:17.110 --> 18:18.220
when that grandson of yours

18:19.110 --> 18:21.330
is able to go on an expedition with the new Pillar State General,

18:22.000 --> 18:24.770
which is General Dian,

18:25.480 --> 18:26.490
he'll understand

18:27.070 --> 18:28.940
all of your painstaking efforts.

18:29.830 --> 18:31.860
But Xie, Mu,

18:32.750 --> 18:33.940
just like what the child

18:34.110 --> 18:35.180
was concerned about,

18:36.070 --> 18:38.700
do you guys truly think First Prince

18:38.790 --> 18:40.220
is worth serving?

18:46.440 --> 18:47.730
Why not?

18:49.350 --> 18:50.570
First Prince

18:51.000 --> 18:52.460
hails from the imperial lineage itself,

18:52.640 --> 18:53.860
and is the legitimate heir to the throne.

18:55.680 --> 18:57.620
He is the manifestation of light itself.

18:58.720 --> 19:01.330
Is there a better master than him?

19:04.920 --> 19:05.810
Moreover,

19:06.480 --> 19:07.700
the bow is already drawn.

19:08.200 --> 19:09.290
The shot has to be fired.

19:10.160 --> 19:10.860
There's no

19:11.550 --> 19:13.570
turning back.

19:23.350 --> 19:23.900
Xuanwu Guardian,

19:24.960 --> 19:25.770
if I turn into a monster,

19:26.070 --> 19:27.290
my father will never let you off!

19:28.270 --> 19:28.860
Xuanwu Guardian,

19:29.070 --> 19:29.730
what should we do now?

19:30.030 --> 19:30.900
If they die here,

19:31.110 --> 19:31.530
I'm afraid

19:31.830 --> 19:33.250
the Inner Security Division will be blamed for this.

19:41.110 --> 19:41.620
The antidote has arrived.

19:42.240 --> 19:42.730
Thank you.

19:43.720 --> 19:44.250
The antidote has arrived?

19:44.510 --> 19:45.730
Give it to me.

19:46.270 --> 19:46.900
You caused trouble for us.

19:47.110 --> 19:47.900
You'll take it last.

19:49.750 --> 19:50.330
Keep them under control.

19:51.070 --> 19:52.980
There's something off about their condition.

19:53.400 --> 19:53.980
One mouthful per person.

19:54.160 --> 19:54.810
No extra dosage.

19:55.070 --> 19:55.650
Yes, ma'am.

19:55.660 --> 19:56.620
Hurry and give me the antidote!

19:56.730 --> 19:57.550
I beg you!

19:58.050 --> 19:59.200
Give it to me!

19:59.290 --> 20:00.480
Give it to me first!

20:01.880 --> 20:02.900
Ms. Yumo, it's all thanks

20:03.200 --> 20:03.730
to your timely arrival.

20:03.960 --> 20:04.980
I'm just here to deliver the antidote.

20:05.680 --> 20:06.180
If you want to thank someone,

20:06.880 --> 20:07.980
you should thank Miss Bai.

20:09.590 --> 20:10.050
Miss Bai.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.180
Is the antidote ready?

20:11.680 --> 20:12.420
Yes, it's ready.

20:15.790 --> 20:17.530
It took me a lot of effort to make it.

20:18.240 --> 20:18.980
Ms. Yumo,

20:19.480 --> 20:20.530
you must keep it safe.

20:20.880 --> 20:21.250
Don't worry.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.140
How should one consume this antidote?

20:23.880 --> 20:25.090
Just take one mouthful,

20:25.640 --> 20:26.420
and they will be cured.

20:28.790 --> 20:29.220
Thank you.

20:36.750 --> 20:37.770
It took her a lot of effort

20:38.000 --> 20:39.050
to create this antidote.

20:39.640 --> 20:40.180
Hurry and give it to me!

20:41.000 --> 20:41.770
I'll surely pay her a visit

20:42.510 --> 20:43.420
and thank her personally once this is over.

20:43.920 --> 20:44.420
Give me a little more.

20:44.750 --> 20:45.290
Give me a little more.

20:51.440 --> 20:52.050
What's going on?

20:56.440 --> 20:57.570
Is there something wrong with the antidote?

21:07.640 --> 21:09.700
How could there be anything wrong with the antidote

21:10.000 --> 21:11.250
made by Medicine King Valley?

21:14.790 --> 21:15.530
It's you again.

21:16.310 --> 21:17.090
That's right.

21:17.480 --> 21:18.420
I'm back.

21:19.590 --> 21:20.810
Your favorite senior brother

21:21.200 --> 21:22.460
is here as well.

21:27.550 --> 21:28.050
Senior Brother?

21:28.680 --> 21:30.330
Although Martial Aunt has neutralized

21:30.440 --> 21:31.810
the poison in them,

21:32.590 --> 21:33.900
it will only end if you neutralize

21:33.960 --> 21:34.700
the caster's poison

21:35.510 --> 21:37.490
or eradicate them

21:37.720 --> 21:39.250
completely.

21:40.070 --> 21:42.010
Martial Aunt never read that book.

21:42.240 --> 21:43.940
Therefore, she doesn't know about it.

21:44.590 --> 21:45.730
But now, we know.

21:46.240 --> 21:46.810
As for you,

21:47.960 --> 21:49.140
it's time to die.

21:55.640 --> 21:56.700
What a shame.

21:57.350 --> 21:59.220
I thought Martial Aunt would be here as well.

22:00.590 --> 22:02.140
I wanted to get rid of her too.

22:02.830 --> 22:03.980
I guess I'll deal with you guys first.

22:13.270 --> 22:15.330
You recognize that he's your senior brother, right?

22:16.030 --> 22:17.380
But he no longer

22:17.440 --> 22:18.420
recognizes you.

22:19.680 --> 22:21.010
Such killing

22:21.160 --> 22:23.660
is truly exhilarating.

22:24.880 --> 22:25.380
Shut up!

22:36.880 --> 22:37.380
Are you okay?

22:44.160 --> 22:45.530
Why aren't you using your three hidden weapons?

22:46.200 --> 22:47.220
If I cast everything aside

22:47.960 --> 22:49.220
and use all of my hidden weapons,

22:50.110 --> 22:50.810
even if I do win the duel,

22:51.640 --> 22:53.530
Senior Brother's body will be broken beyond repair.

22:55.270 --> 22:55.900
It seems

22:56.590 --> 22:57.460
you still need me.

23:01.720 --> 23:02.490
100-Spider Array,

23:02.920 --> 23:03.420
rise!

23:19.790 --> 23:20.730
Spider Woman,

23:21.200 --> 23:22.290
do you actually think

23:22.350 --> 23:23.770
you can kill

23:24.030 --> 23:25.050
a Gold-Body Puppet

23:25.070 --> 23:26.290
with those spiders of yours?

23:26.480 --> 23:27.620
What if all of my spiders

23:28.550 --> 23:29.620
had consumed this?

23:30.640 --> 23:31.810
The antidote has already merged into their bloodstream.

23:32.880 --> 23:34.050
Does that mean

23:34.640 --> 23:35.810
it can neutralize your puppet poison?

23:46.440 --> 23:47.180
Yumo!

23:49.550 --> 23:50.140
Watch out!

24:07.160 --> 24:07.940
That hurts!

24:09.680 --> 24:11.010
This is Senior Brother's first time speaking

24:12.350 --> 24:13.460
after encountering us.

24:14.050 --> 24:14.900
The antidote

24:16.200 --> 24:17.460
is starting to work.

24:20.030 --> 24:20.530
Don't go there!

24:21.240 --> 24:22.770
He absorbed Xuewei's poison before this.

24:23.070 --> 24:24.180
After that, he absorbed all of the poison mist

24:24.350 --> 24:25.660
at He-Yu Clinic.

24:26.000 --> 24:27.140
Now, his body is filled with poison.

24:27.590 --> 24:28.180
Have you lost your mind?

24:31.270 --> 24:32.140
The poison in his body

24:32.160 --> 24:33.050
has been basically neutralized.

24:33.480 --> 24:34.330
I just need to expel

24:34.350 --> 24:35.530
the rest of the poison with my zhenqi,

24:35.960 --> 24:36.570
and he'll be fine.

24:37.110 --> 24:38.770
But the other poisons in his body aren't neutralized yet.

24:39.200 --> 24:39.660
It doesn't matter.

24:40.200 --> 24:41.050
I'm Tang Lianyue.

24:41.480 --> 24:42.180
Such poisons

24:42.830 --> 24:43.770
won't affect me!

24:48.000 --> 24:48.490
Lianyue.

24:51.110 --> 24:51.900
Lianyue.

24:53.880 --> 24:54.330
Senior Brother.

24:59.640 --> 25:00.250
Lianyue,

25:01.070 --> 25:02.140
kill me.

25:03.550 --> 25:05.330
My internal organs

25:06.350 --> 25:07.490
are all broken beyond repair.

25:10.400 --> 25:11.460
Just kill me.

25:11.920 --> 25:12.660
You want to die?

25:12.920 --> 25:13.770
You wish!

25:25.270 --> 25:25.900
Tang Lianyue!

25:26.680 --> 25:27.810
Everyone will die if the poison mist

25:28.160 --> 25:29.250
enters the building!

25:39.640 --> 25:40.140
Senior Brother!

25:40.680 --> 25:41.380
Kill me!

25:42.880 --> 25:43.980
Kill me!

25:46.160 --> 25:46.860
Lianyue!

25:48.720 --> 25:50.490
Remember what I told you!

25:52.030 --> 25:52.860
When someone

25:53.680 --> 25:54.660
blackmails you

25:55.750 --> 25:56.730
with my life,

25:59.590 --> 26:00.290
you don't need to care.

26:00.880 --> 26:01.730
Just charge ahead!

26:07.680 --> 26:08.660
Did you hear me?

26:12.920 --> 26:13.860
Do it!

26:15.750 --> 26:16.620
Lianyue!

26:34.400 --> 26:34.900
Yumo!

26:38.640 --> 26:39.810
I'm truly sorry.

26:42.310 --> 26:43.010
Lianyue.

26:46.510 --> 26:47.220
I'll entrust Tang Clan

26:49.480 --> 26:50.940
to you now.

26:50.940 --> 26:55.620
♪I once looked upon the flaws of the world with my eyes♪

26:55.620 --> 26:58.900
♪A fleeting breeze snuffs out the name I bore♪

26:59.590 --> 27:00.490
As for the girl

27:01.790 --> 27:03.220
who blocked my attack on your behalf,

27:06.640 --> 27:07.900
you have to cherish her.

27:08.200 --> 27:08.860
Senior Brother!

27:10.540 --> 27:14.180
♪I traded all for one look, without regret♪

27:14.220 --> 27:21.700
♪The snow is gone, and in the cold, new leaves begin to breathe♪

27:22.070 --> 27:23.730
My perfect drugged puppet,

27:24.310 --> 27:25.980
you ruined it just like that!

27:29.000 --> 27:29.660
These three

27:30.070 --> 27:31.010
were experts

27:31.030 --> 27:32.330
nearing the Free-Heaven level.

27:33.270 --> 27:33.860
It's a shame

27:33.920 --> 27:35.900
that they weren't as talented as your senior brother.

27:36.440 --> 27:38.220
They cannot become Gold-Body Puppets.

27:39.000 --> 27:39.490
However,

27:39.790 --> 27:41.420
they are more than enough

27:41.550 --> 27:42.530
to deal with you two!

28:03.880 --> 28:04.290
Yumo.

28:13.880 --> 28:14.770
Tang Lianyue.

28:18.550 --> 28:19.660
I...

28:22.830 --> 28:23.860
I'll ask you

28:24.350 --> 28:25.460
one last time.

28:30.110 --> 28:31.220
Will you

28:33.480 --> 28:34.730
marry me

28:36.160 --> 28:36.980
or not?

28:42.200 --> 28:42.770
I will.

28:56.680 --> 28:57.290
If so...

29:00.000 --> 29:01.290
If so,

29:02.790 --> 29:07.180
can you come to our Falling Stars Pavilion, then?

29:08.550 --> 29:13.660
No one has held a wedding there before.

29:16.240 --> 29:16.810
Okay.

29:21.880 --> 29:22.620
I'll follow your will.

29:26.660 --> 29:31.940
♪Whose longing guards this land unharmed?♪

29:34.750 --> 29:35.420
So,

29:37.000 --> 29:38.660
how will you come?

29:40.790 --> 29:44.380
Can you make it grand?

29:46.590 --> 29:47.250
This way,

29:48.310 --> 29:50.570
it'll make me look good too.

29:55.270 --> 29:55.940
After all,

29:56.640 --> 29:57.290
I was the one

29:58.880 --> 30:00.730
pursuing you all along.

30:02.310 --> 30:03.490
In front of Yu...

30:04.480 --> 30:06.530
I suppose I was pretty embarrassed

30:08.270 --> 30:10.980
in front of Yu and the rest.

30:17.790 --> 30:18.860
With rivers raging

30:21.240 --> 30:22.330
and thunder splitting the sky,

30:26.720 --> 30:29.490
I will ride the red phoenix to take you as my bride.

30:39.440 --> 30:40.570
Silly boy.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.730
Phoenix doesn't exist

30:44.440 --> 30:46.570
in this world.

30:46.980 --> 30:52.460
♪You are well, just as you were at the start♪

30:57.200 --> 30:57.730
It does exist.

30:59.700 --> 31:06.940
♪Do not long for the sorrow of separation♪

31:17.110 --> 31:17.660
Is that...

31:18.240 --> 31:19.290
Outside of Pipa Pavilion of Jiujiang,

31:19.960 --> 31:21.660
I was known for my three hidden weapons.

31:22.880 --> 31:23.460
The first one is

31:24.030 --> 31:25.140
Cries of 1,000 Birds.

31:26.070 --> 31:26.770
The second one is

31:27.240 --> 31:28.220
Skywrath Thunder.

31:29.110 --> 31:29.900
As for the third one,

31:30.590 --> 31:31.940
it's unleashed when I use Cries of 1,000 Birds

31:32.000 --> 31:33.730
and Skywrath Thunder at the same time.

31:34.400 --> 31:35.770
It's called Phoenix Descent!

31:40.640 --> 31:41.290
This is...

32:08.400 --> 32:10.220
So, phoenix does exist, huh?

32:15.590 --> 32:16.180
I'll take you with me.

32:38.510 --> 32:39.050
Ruojin,

32:40.550 --> 32:41.620
you summoned me here.

32:42.400 --> 32:43.940
I suppose you have something to discuss.

32:44.750 --> 32:45.700
I heard

32:46.680 --> 32:47.730
that there was a commotion

32:48.680 --> 32:50.180
in Tianqi City today.

32:50.960 --> 32:51.420
Ruojin,

32:52.440 --> 32:53.250
were you referring

32:53.830 --> 32:54.980
to the children's rhyme?

32:59.920 --> 33:00.660
Could it be

33:01.550 --> 33:02.700
that you also think

33:03.160 --> 33:05.140
I would stage a rebellion

33:06.000 --> 33:06.770
during tomorrow's Imperial Assembly?

33:16.310 --> 33:18.090
There was one more Dragonseal Scroll.

33:19.110 --> 33:19.860
It's been so many years.

33:20.720 --> 33:21.860
Is it still nowhere to be found?

33:23.030 --> 33:23.570
Indeed.

33:24.790 --> 33:25.620
But it'll definitely

33:26.400 --> 33:27.570
show itself today.

33:35.550 --> 33:36.090
Ruofeng,

33:36.720 --> 33:37.860
I trust you forever.

33:39.750 --> 33:40.700
But you need to know this.

33:41.680 --> 33:42.290
Not everyone in this world

33:43.070 --> 33:45.250
live by absolute principles,

33:46.400 --> 33:47.770
unlike you.

33:53.070 --> 33:53.570
Tonight,

33:54.640 --> 33:56.290
I will retrieve the Dragonseal Scroll

33:56.680 --> 33:57.770
on your behalf.

33:58.960 --> 34:00.010
As for tomorrow's Imperial Assembly,

34:00.510 --> 34:01.010
nothing will

34:01.480 --> 34:02.770
go wrong.

34:04.160 --> 34:05.250
I can rest at ease

34:06.350 --> 34:07.290
upon hearing that from you.

35:01.030 --> 35:02.380
The snacks were great.

35:03.110 --> 35:04.090
The drinks were excellent as well.

35:05.550 --> 35:06.740
Jin Xuan, I suppose

35:07.150 --> 35:08.380
you were the one who prepared them.

35:11.070 --> 35:12.380
I was just doing my duty.

36:10.740 --> 36:14.220
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

36:14.260 --> 36:18.140
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

36:19.980 --> 36:23.460
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

36:23.500 --> 36:27.340
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

36:29.340 --> 36:32.620
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

36:32.740 --> 36:34.820
♪Still I can't let go♪

36:34.980 --> 36:38.420
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

36:38.900 --> 36:41.100
♪My heart no longer my own♪

36:41.220 --> 36:46.220
♪No one can escape from love♪

37:02.820 --> 37:06.540
♪How many hidden feelings♪

37:06.660 --> 37:10.740
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

37:11.980 --> 37:15.860
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

37:15.980 --> 37:20.220
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

37:21.340 --> 37:24.220
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

37:24.300 --> 37:28.540
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

37:30.820 --> 37:34.820
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

37:34.860 --> 37:38.300
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

37:39.820 --> 37:43.260
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

37:43.340 --> 37:47.140
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

37:49.060 --> 37:52.500
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

37:52.540 --> 37:56.380
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

37:58.420 --> 38:01.660
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

38:01.780 --> 38:03.860
♪Still I can't let go♪

38:04.060 --> 38:07.460
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

38:07.940 --> 38:10.140
♪My heart no longer my own♪

38:10.220 --> 38:15.260
♪No one can escape from love♪

38:22.620 --> 38:24.820
♪My heart no longer my own♪

38:24.900 --> 38:29.940
♪No one can escape from love♪
